{"id":"9ef3c71816085a2a","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-conl.md","title":"coNL补类","display":"df-conl — coNL补类","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-conl","aliases":["28-df-conl"],"display":"df-conl — coNL补类","depends_on":["[[28-df-nl]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach; Theorem 4.20 and §4.3.2","source_printed_pages":"90–92","source_pdf_pages":"116–118","source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-conl"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-conl</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-conl — coNL补类"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ba1abccdb0412836\" href=\"?note=ba1abccdb0412836\" title=\"28-df-nl\">28-df-nl</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach; Theorem 4.20 and §4.3.2"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"90–92"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"116–118"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{NL}\">\\(\\mathbf{NL}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ba1abccdb0412836\" href=\"?note=ba1abccdb0412836\" title=\"28-df-nl\">28-df-nl</a>；补集相对于全部有限二进制串取。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{coNL}\\coloneqq\\{\\Sigma^*\\setminus L:L\\in\\mathbf{NL}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf{coNL}\\coloneqq\\{\\Sigma^*\\setminus L:L\\in\\mathbf{NL}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是语言补类，不是逐分支交换非确定型机器的接受和拒绝。后者产生全称接受条件，不能直接当作NL机器。</p>\n<p>来源：用户所给 Arora–Barak PDF，Theorem 4.20 and §4.3.2；印刷 pp.90–92 / PDF pp.116–118。本次核对范围：定义陈述与本地形式化。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-nl","status":"resolved","id":"ba1abccdb0412836","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-nl]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-nl","status":"resolved","id":"ba1abccdb0412836","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$\\mathbf{NL}$ 见 [[28-df-nl]]；补集相对于全部有限二进制串取。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{NL}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{coNL}\\coloneqq\\{\\Sigma^*\\setminus L:L\\in\\mathbf{NL}\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1082,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-285","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-conl]]、[[28-prop-nl-contained-p]]、[[28-cor-l-strict-pspace]]、[[28-df-savitch-reachability]]、[[28-prop-finite-reachability-bound]]。"}],"outgoing":["ba1abccdb0412836"]}